  <Title type="string">Towards how to hang a painting upside down on purpose</Title>
  <synopsis type="string">Hiroshi Whitehorse talks about the long argument with the colour blue. A curator joined for ten minutes and left convinced that the chair was part of the exhibition.</synopsis>
